WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.905 --> 00:00:17.047
young monk ran to the government office in Hapcheon.

2
00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:23.832
He told the official what he had seen.

3
00:00:23.852 --> 00:00:27.154
"Bandits are robbing the temple?"

4
00:00:27.635 --> 00:00:29.036
The official was stunned.

5
00:00:31.168 --> 00:00:34.691
"Yes sir," the monk said, out of breath.

6
00:00:39.615 --> 00:00:41.936
The official quickly gathered his soldiers.

7
00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:47.300
They ran toward the temple.

8
00:00:53.765 --> 00:00:57.028
In the temple the bandits finished filling their carts.

9
00:00:59.456 --> 00:01:02.477
"We should get out of here before we get caught," Gildong said.

10
00:01:02.497 --> 00:01:06.459
"Let's go through the forest," Mok said.

11
00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:09.401
"It will be safer than traveling on the road."

12
00:01:11.021 --> 00:01:13.202
Gildong looked at the carts and frowned.

13
00:01:13.222 --> 00:01:15.323
"The carts are too heavy.

14
00:01:16.144 --> 00:01:18.525
Pulling them through the forest won't work."

15
00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:21.606
"What should we do?"

16
00:01:22.106 --> 00:01:22.887
Mok asked.

17
00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:25.628
Gildong thought for a moment.

18
00:01:28.196 --> 00:01:29.697
"Take the main road back to the hideout.

19
00:01:30.798 --> 00:01:32.019
I'll make sure no one finds you."

20
00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.761
Mok looked confused, but he nodded.

21
00:01:35.781 --> 00:01:37.402
"Move out!"

22
00:01:43.546 --> 00:01:46.609
After the bandits left, Gildong opened his fan.

23
00:01:46.629 --> 00:01:49.691
"Transform!" Poof!

24
00:01:50.251 --> 00:01:52.533
Gildong turned into an old monk.

25
00:01:53.493 --> 00:01:54.694
He checked his clothing.

26
00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:58.948
"Not bad," he thought, grinning.

27
00:02:00.389 --> 00:02:01.769
He ran toward town.

28
00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:08.471
Soldiers carrying spears were hurrying along the road.

29
00:02:09.371 --> 00:02:10.832
An official was leading them.

30
00:02:12.512 --> 00:02:14.073
Gildong ran toward them.

31
00:02:14.093 --> 00:02:16.313
"Help! Help!"

32
00:02:22.555 --> 00:02:23.215
"What happened?"

33
00:02:23.616 --> 00:02:24.616
the official asked.

34
00:02:25.492 --> 00:02:28.294
"Bandits stole everything from the temple storeroom!

35
00:02:29.135 --> 00:02:30.375
Then they ran off!"

36
00:02:30.796 --> 00:02:31.636
Gildong said.

37
00:02:31.656 --> 00:02:33.918
"Which way did they go?"

38
00:02:34.298 --> 00:02:35.339
the official asked.

39
00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:38.861
Gildong pointed into the forest.

40
00:02:44.385 --> 00:02:45.826
went deep into the woods.

41
00:02:46.646 --> 00:02:47.707
Please catch them.

42
00:02:48.107 --> 00:02:56.398
Hurry!" The official and the soldiers ran into the woods.

43
00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:07.145
Gildong chuckled.

44
00:03:07.165 --> 00:03:10.908
"That was too easy."

45
00:03:13.009 --> 00:03:17.232
Poof! He turned back into himself and opened his fan.

46
00:03:17.252 --> 00:03:19.334
"To the hideout!"

47
00:03:23.276 --> 00:03:26.759
Thwoosh! Wind rushed, and the scenery around him changed.

48
00:03:33.104 --> 00:03:35.626
In an instant he was back at the hideout.

49
00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:41.771
Gildong knocked into someone.

50
00:03:45.354 --> 00:03:47.636
Nabi got up and dusted herself off.

51
00:03:47.656 --> 00:03:50.338
"Watch where you're going, little lord!"

52
00:03:50.358 --> 00:03:53.569
"Sorry," Gildong said.

53
00:03:53.589 --> 00:03:55.690
"Where are the others?"

54
00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:56.871
Nabi asked.

55
00:03:56.891 --> 00:03:59.393
"They'll be here soon."

56
00:04:01.594 --> 00:04:06.037
A while later Gildong heard singing as the other thieves arrived.

57
00:04:06.057 --> 00:04:10.360
"We robbed the temple!

58
00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.961
It was very simple!

59
00:04:12.421 --> 00:04:14.643
Thanks to Hong Gildong!"

60
00:04:19.046 --> 00:04:22.168
The thieves' carts were loaded with grain and treasure.

61
00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:25.561
Some of the men were wrapped in colorful silk.

62
00:04:29.383 --> 00:04:31.144
Nabi's eyes went wide.

63
00:04:31.164 --> 00:04:33.185
"We're rich!"

64
00:04:35.467 --> 00:04:37.047
Mok jumped onto a cart.

65
00:04:38.028 --> 00:04:39.829
"Hong Gildong should be our leader!

66
00:04:40.789 --> 00:04:42.550
We couldn't have done it without him!"

67
00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.231
"Are you sure?"

68
00:04:44.571 --> 00:04:46.092
Gildong said in surprise.

69
00:04:46.112 --> 00:04:48.373
"I just joined your group."

70
00:04:49.614 --> 00:04:52.836
The thieves cheered noisily and sang again.

71
00:04:53.663 --> 00:04:54.695
"We'll be rich
